---
import RoadScene from './RoadScene.astro';
---

<RoadScene />
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <h1 id="hero-title">Run every worktree at once, each on its own localhost.</h1>
  <p class="hero-lede">
    <strong>Stop fighting over port 3000.</strong>
    devlanes runs your dev stack once per Git worktree. Each one gets its own ports, its own{' '}
    <code>https://myapp1.localhost</code> and its own database, and a daemon keeps it running after
    you close the terminal.
  </p>
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a class="button primary" href="#install">
      Install devlanes
    </a>
    <a class="button" href="/docs/">
      Read the docs
    </a>
  </div>
  <p class="hero-facts">
    An open source command line tool for your own machine. Apache-2.0, written in Rust. Nothing to
    sign up for and nothing hosted.
  </p>
</section>
<span class="sign-credit">Car models by Kenney, CC0</span>
